### ==========================
### TESTING NOTES
### ==========================

### After creating family profiles above, test:
### 1. Generate itinerary: POST /api/itinerary/generate/{familyProfileId}
### 2. Generate packing: POST /api/packingchecklist/generate/{familyProfileId}
### 3. Get itinerary: GET /api/itinerary/family/{familyProfileId}
### 4. Get packing: GET /api/packingchecklist/family/{familyProfileId}

### CITY DATA INCLUDES:
### - Parks (Lodhi Garden, Cubbon Park, Marina Drive, etc.)
### - Zoos (Delhi Zoo, Mumbai Zoo, Nahargarh Zoo)
### - Beaches (Baga Beach, Anjuna Beach - Goa only)
### - Museums (Indian Museum, Birla Planetarium, etc.)
### - Restaurants (Family-friendly dining in every city)
### - Indoor Play (Snow Kingdom, Essel World, Innovative Children's Park)

### TEMPERATURE INFO:
### Delhi: 25°C    | Jaipur: 26°C   | Pune: 24°C
### Mumbai: 28°C   | Goa: 30°C (hottest)
### Bangalore: 22°C (coolest) | Hyderabad: 27°C | Kolkata: 26°C

### EMERGENCY CONTACTS IN EVERY CITY:
### - Major Hospital (Apollo, Fortis, Max, etc.)
### - Pediatric Clinic (for child-specific care)
### - Emergency Number: 102 (nationwide)

### AMENITIES TRACKED:
### ? High chairs availability
### ? Kids menu
### ? Changing rooms
### ? Stroller friendly
### ? GPS coordinates
### ? Average duration
### ? Kid-friendly score (1-5)
### ? Walkability score (1-5)
